From f44dc9f87d35d511e65734f6d92ebdc5dc527a1b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matej Kenda <matejken@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 17:00:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(lto10): add Ultrium 10 and Ultrium 10 Premium

Density codes 0x62 and 0x63, medium types 0xa8, 0xa9 and 0xac, and the
ULT3580-TDA personality, which takes Ultrium 10 media only: generation 10 is
not compatible with earlier cartridges. Values from the IBM LTO SCSI Reference
GA32-0928-08.

(cherry picked from commit 1cd21f737dde4d48b99f5eccfb38bdaeaa2d9711)
---
 etc/generate_device_conf.in      |  45 +++++++
 etc/generate_library_contents.in |   4 +
 include/ssc.h                    |   1 +
 include/vtlcart.h                |   6 +-
 include/vtllib.h                 |   8 ++
 man/edit_tape.1.in               |   2 +-
 man/mktape.1.in                  |   2 +
 usr/cmd/edit_tape.c              |   2 +-
